electionControl with type=\"radio\" -->\n<origam-selection-control\n  class=\"origam-radio-btn\"\n  v-model=\"model\"\n  type=\"radio\"\n  :true-icon=\"trueIcon\"\n  :false-icon=\"falseIcon\"\n  v-bind=\"controlProps\"\n  @click:label=\"handleClickLabel\"\n>\n  <template #default><slot name=\"default\" /></template>\n  <template #input=\"{ props, icon, model }\">\n    <slot name=\"input\" v-bind=\"{ props, icon, model }\" />\n  </template>\n  <template #label><slot name=\"label\" /></template>\n</origam-selection-control>", "legend": [{"cls": ".origam-radio-btn", "num": 1, "descriptionKey": "components.radio_btn.anatomy.root", "descriptionFallback": "Root class applied to the OrigamSelectionControl wrapper. Delegates all rendering to the selection-control via filterProps."}, {"cls": ".origam-selection-control__input (ring)", "num": 2, "descriptionKey": "components.radio_btn.anatomy.ring", "descriptionFallback": "Circular ring. Border-color transitions from border.default → action.primary.bg when checked. 20 × 20 px, border-radius: full."}, {"cls": ".origam-selection-control__input (dot)", "num": 3, "descriptionKey": "components.radio_btn.anatomy.dot", "descriptionFallback": "Inner dot (10 × 10 px). Animates from scale(0) → scale(1) on check. Background-color: action.primary.bg."}, {"cls": ".origam-selection-control__label", "num": 4, "descriptionKey": "components.radio_btn.anatomy.label", "descriptionFallback": "Label text area. Color: text.primary. Renders the label prop or #default slot."}], "classes": [{"cls": "origam-radio-btn", "descriptionKey": "components.radio_btn.anatomy.root", "descriptionFallback": "Root class applied on top of OrigamSelectionControl."}], "svgDesc": "Schematic of the RadioBtn component delegating to OrigamSelectionControl.", "svgTitle": "Anatomy of OrigamRadioBtn", "rootClass": "origam-radio-btn", "figcaption": "Anatomy of <code>&lt;origam-radio-btn&gt;</code> — 4 internal parts: the selection-control root ①, the radio ring ②, the selecti