    }', NULL, NULL, false, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Directive modifiers: `center` anchors the wave origin to the element centre; `circle` forces a perfectly circular wave; `stop` prevents event propagation when the ripple triggers.', 1, false, NULL, NULL);
